---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout 
  title="AI Automation for Accounting Firms | The One Group" 
  description="AI automation for accounting firms: bookkeeping categorization, invoice chasing, client onboarding, and workflow. Do more client work with less admin. Free discovery call."
>
  <!-- JSON-LD -->
  <script type="application/ld+json" set:html={JSON.stringify({
    "@context": "https://schema.org",
    "@type": "Service",
    "name": "AI Automation for Accounting Firms — The One Group",
    "serviceType": "AI Automation for Accounting",
    "provider": {
      "@type": "LocalBusiness",
      "name": "The One Group",
      "url": "https://theonegroup.info/",
      "telephone": "+17547998676",
      "email": "akennedy@theonegroup.info",
      "priceRange": "$$"
    },
    "description": "Custom AI automation for accounting firms: bookkeeping categorization, invoice chasing, client onboarding, and workflow automation.",
    "areaServed": "South Florida, Miami, United States"
  })} />
  
  <!-- Hero -->
  <section class="pt-32 pb-20 px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 bg-gradient-to-br from-gray-50 via-white to-brand-50/30 dark:from-gray-950 dark:via-gray-950 dark:to-brand-950/20 relative overflow-hidden">
    <div class="absolute -top-40 -right-40 w-[500px] h-[500px] rounded-full bg-accent-200/20 dark:bg-accent-900/10 blur-[120px] pointer-events-none" />
    <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto relative z-10">
      <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto text-center">
        <span class="text-sm font-semibold text-brand-600 dark:text-brand-400 uppercase tracking-widest">For Accounting Firms</span>
        <h1 class="text-4xl sm:text-5xl md:text-6xl font-display font-bold tracking-tight leading-[1.08] mt-4 mb-6">
          AI Automation for <span class="bg-gradient-to-r from-brand-600 via-brand-500 to-accent-500 bg-clip-text text-transparent">Accounting Firms</span>
        </h1>
        <p class="text-lg sm:text-xl text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-400 max-w-2xl mx-auto leading-relaxed mb-10">
          Your firm runs on billable hours — but your team is buried in data entry, chasing invoices, 
          and manual follow-up. AI automation handles the routine so your people do more client work.
        </p>
        <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center justify-center gap-4">
          <a href="/contact" class="inline-flex items-center gap-2.5 px-8 py-4 rounded-xl font-semibold text-white bg-gradient-to-r from-brand-600 to-accent-600 hover:from-brand-500 hover:to-accent-500 transition-all duration-200 shadow-lg shadow-brand-500/25 hover:-translate-y-0.5">
            Get a Free Workflow Audit
            <svg class="w-5 h-5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M17 8l4 4m0 0l-4 4m4-4H3" /></svg>
          </a>
          <a href="tel:7547998676" class="inline-flex items-center gap-2.5 px-8 py-4 rounded-xl font-semibold text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300 border-2 border-gray-200 dark:border-gray-700 hover:border-brand-500 transition-all duration-200">
            Call (754) 799-8676
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
  
  <!-- Pain points + solutions -->
  <section class="py-20 px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 bg-white dark:bg-gray-950">
    <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto">
      <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto text-center mb-14">
        <span class="text-sm font-semibold text-brand-600 dark:text-brand-400 uppercase tracking-widest">Pain Points → Solutions</span>
        <h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-display font-bold mt-3 mb-4">Billing Time Is Wasted on Busywork</h2>
        <p class="text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-400 leading-relaxed">Categorizing transactions, chasing clients for documents, and reminding them to pay — none of it is billable. Here's how AI automation frees your team.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-8">
        <div class="card p-8">
          <h3 class="text-xl font-display font-bold text-gray-900 dark:text-gray-100 mb-3">Bookkeeping Categorization</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-400 leading-relaxed">AI learns your firm's chart of accounts and categorizes transactions automatically. Cleaner books with a fraction of the manual effort across every client file.</p>
          <p class="text-sm font-semibold text-emerald-600 dark:text-emerald-400 mt-4">Outcome: hours saved per week</p>
        </div>
        <div class="card p-8">
          <h3 class="text-xl font-display font-bold text-gray-900 dark:text-gray-100 mb-3">Invoice Chasing</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-400 leading-relaxed">Overdue invoices get chased automatically with polite, personalized reminders on a schedule you control. Your receivables improve without awkward follow-up emails.</p>
          <p class="text-sm font-semibold text-brand-600 dark:text-brand-400 mt-4">Outcome: paid faster</p>
        </div>
        <div class="card p-8">
          <h3 class="text-xl font-display font-bold text-gray-900 dark:text-gray-100 mb-3">Client Onboarding</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-400 leading-relaxed">New clients get a guided, automated onboarding flow — engagement letters, information requests, and welcome materials sent and tracked without staff chasing every step.</p>
          <p class="text-sm font-semibold text-brand-600 dark:text-brand-400 mt-4">Outcome: smoother starts</p>
        </div>
        <div class="card p-8">
          <h3 class="text-xl font-display font-bold text-gray-900 dark:text-gray-100 mb-3">Workflow Automation</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-400 leading-relaxed">Document requests, status updates, and recurring tasks handled automatically. Your team sees exactly what's next, and clients stay informed without manual nudges.</p>
          <p class="text-sm font-semibold text-accent-600 dark:text-accent-400 mt-4">Outcome: more billable work</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
  
  <!-- What you get -->
  <section class="py-20 px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 bg-gray-50 dark:bg-gray-900">
    <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto">
      <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto text-center mb-14">
        <span class="text-sm font-semibold text-brand-600 dark:text-brand-400 uppercase tracking-widest">Measurable Outcomes</span>
        <h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-display font-bold mt-3 mb-4">Automation Results for Accounting Firms</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-6">
        <div class="card p-8 text-center">
          <p class="text-4xl font-bold bg-gradient-to-r from-emerald-600 to-brand-600 bg-clip-text text-transparent font-display">More</p>
          <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-gray-900 dark:text-gray-100 mt-3 mb-2">Billable Time</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-400">Reclaim hours from routine admin and reinvest them in client work.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="card p-8 text-center">
          <p class="text-4xl font-bold bg-gradient-to-r from-brand-600 to-accent-600 bg-clip-text text-transparent font-display">Faster</p>
          <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-gray-900 dark:text-gray-100 mt-3 mb-2">Collections</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-400">Automated invoice chasing gets you paid faster with less effort.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="card p-8 text-center">
          <p class="text-4xl font-bold bg-gradient-to-r from-accent-600 to-brand-600 bg-clip-text text-transparent font-display">Scalable</p>
          <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-gray-900 dark:text-gray-100 mt-3 mb-2">Client Onboarding</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-400">Take on more clients without adding proportional admin overhead.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
  
  <!-- FAQ -->
  <section class="py-20 px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 bg-white dark:bg-gray-950">
    <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto">
      <div class="text-center mb-12">
        <span class="text-sm font-semibold text-brand-600 dark:text-brand-400 uppercase tracking-widest">FAQ</span>
        <h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-display font-bold mt-3 mb-4">Accounting Automation — Questions</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="space-y-6">
        <div class="card p-6">
          <h3 class="font-semibold text-gray-900 dark:text-gray-100 mb-2">Will AI make mistakes in client books?</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-400 leading-relaxed">AI dramatically reduces routine categorization effort, but we design workflows with human review checkpoints. Your accountants stay in control; AI just removes the grunt work.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="card p-6">
          <h3 class="font-semibold text-gray-900 dark:text-gray-100 mb-2">Is client data secure?</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-400 leading-relaxed">Yes. We build with role-based access and logging, and work within your firm's security and confidentiality policies. You always control who sees what.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="card p-6">
          <h3 class="font-semibold text-gray-900 dark:text-gray-100 mb-2">Will this integrate with my practice software?</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-400 leading-relaxed">Almost always. We integrate with the bookkeeping, invoicing, and practice-management tools most firms use. We'll confirm during your free audit.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="card p-6">
          <h3 class="font-semibold text-gray-900 dark:text-gray-100 mb-2">What does it cost?</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-400 leading-relaxed">Our audit starts at $2,500, and custom implementation typically runs $2,500&ndash;$10,000 depending on the workflows you want automated.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
  
  <!-- CTA -->
  <section class="py-20 px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 bg-gray-50 dark:bg-gray-900">
    <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto text-center">
      <h2 class="text-3xl font-display font-bold mb-4">Do More Client Work, Less Admin</h2>
      <p class="text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-400 mb-8">
        Book a free discovery call. We'll map your firm's workflow and show you where automation saves the most time.
      </p>
      <a href="/contact" class="inline-flex items-center gap-2.5 px-8 py-4 rounded-xl font-semibold text-white bg-gradient-to-r from-brand-600 to-accent-600 hover:from-brand-500 hover:to-accent-500 transition-all duration-200 shadow-lg shadow-brand-500/25 hover:-translate-y-0.5">
        Book a Free Call
        <svg class="w-5 h-5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M17 8l4 4m0 0l-4 4m4-4H3" /></svg>
      </a>
      <p class="text-sm text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-400 mt-4">
        Or call <a href="tel:7547998676" class="text-brand-600 dark:text-brand-400 font-medium underline underline-offset-2">(754) 799-8676</a>.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
